# The servo-side motion profile, loaded once at process setup and read by both
# control cogs.
#
# Protobuf text of `brenn_reachy.cogs.config_clk_proto.ServoProfile`, which the
# compiler generates from the `ServoProfile` schema in `config.clk`. Read as it
# is: the box binds it by path, and the casing converts it to the message the
# dial hands the cog.
#
# One file, two readers. The session writes this pair into all nine servos when
# it commissions the machine; the decision tick builds its plant model from the
# same pair, so what it judges a joint against is the trajectory the machine's
# own generators are running. A second statement of either number is a screen
# sized for a machine nobody commissioned.

# The servo-side motion profile the commission sequencer writes, in the
# registers' own units (0.229 rev/min for velocity, 214.577 rev/min² for
# acceleration).
#
# This pair is the measured velocity cap of the recorded library tour: every
# joint class chasing a goal more than 0.1 rad away travels a median of
# 0.0230-0.0245 rad per 20 ms period, against the 0.023981 rad the velocity
# below converts to, and a joint setting off from rest ramps at the
# acceleration. The whole tour ran velocity-saturated -- the content asks for
# 3-20 rad/s against a 1.2 rad/s ceiling -- so the pair is what shapes the
# motion rather than a backstop under it. Whether it is the right pair for this
# machine is still nobody's measurement, and the mark for that is on the
# schema's own field in `cogs/config.clk`.
#
# The bench's trial-validated figures (400/600, including an 855°/s antenna
# sweep and the 0.8 s presence gesture) were sized for a host commanding whole
# moves, where the profile is only the backstop under host-side shaping and a
# tight one throttles the shaped motion itself. The session streams
# step-bounded setpoints instead, one per cycle, which is what the low pair is
# for.
#
# Zero in either register is a servo with no generator at all. Both readers
# refuse it before anything is commanded.
profile_acceleration: 20
profile_velocity: 50
